      "background": "#333333",
      "content": "You set this in motion. This <br/>\nwas unfolding before your eyes. You<br/>\nwere devastated. You<br/>\nwere blocks from the White House. You<br/>\nwere recalling your reaction. You <br/>\nquieted. This is for everyone. You </br>\nwere virtually sorrowful. You <br/>\nwere actual. Am I still there? Your <br/>\nmind and body were in a different state. You <br/>\nwent on to recount at a staccato pace. You <br/>\nwent on in elliptical passages. You <br/>\nhad pain in watching your creation so distorted. You <br/>\nare now embarking on a determined third act. You <br/>\nhave for some time been working on a new platform. Yours <br/>\nwas an apparent solid thing with democratic roots but it <br/>\nhas been taken. The futures were fast approaching. Human rights <br/>\nwere being protected in 2009. Résumés <br/>\nwere functioning like the human brain. Political views <br/>\nare more valuable. Deoxyribo nucleic acid <br/>\nis enquiring within upon everything. Am I still there? Born <br/>\nin the early 1960s and growing up in London, what <br/>\nhas been produced <br/>\nis a large-scale emergent phenomenon which <br/>\nis anti-human. ",
